Bundled skills (`skills/`, MIT)
-------------------------------

The skill catalog is styled after, and in some cases ported from, the
open-source catalogs of:

- NousResearch/hermes-agent (https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent) — MIT
- openclaw — MIT

The arXiv Search Skill (`skills/research/arxiv/`) — including its
`scripts/search_arxiv.py` — is a direct port from hermes-agent; the original
upstream-origin note is preserved in its frontmatter.

The remaining skills were authored for birkin in the style of the upstream
catalogs above and are released under MIT to honor that lineage. Each
`SKILL.md` carries `license: MIT` in its frontmatter.

Skills mirrored at runtime via `birkin skills sync` (stored in the user's
`~/.birkin/skills/mirrors/`) retain their upstream licenses (typically MIT
for hermes-agent skills). birkin does not redistribute these in its source
tree or distribution artifacts.

